architect › Plan sent to coder. Summary of what I decided and what I expect back:

**Diagnosis:** In `src/paginate.ts`, `paginate` computes `start = page * perPage`, so page 1 slices from index `perPage` — exactly the reported symptom (first page shows the second page's items, first `perPage` items never shown).

